      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks have transformed precision timekeeping and opened a powerful platform for tests of fundamental physics and quantum measurement.",
        "attribution": "Katori and Ye made distinct, central contributions to realizing and advancing optical lattice clocks.",
        "maturity": "The method is experimentally established, with continuing gains in accuracy and applications.",
        "uncertainties": [
